#: kt
msgid "Back {}"
msgstr "Wstecz {}"

#. TRANSLATORS: TalkBack label for the read-aloud bar's forward button when navigating audio by time; {} is an amount like "30 seconds"
#: kt
msgid "Forward {}"
msgstr "Do przodu {}"

